      "summary": "SCS-002 Commerce MVP — Stage 3 business logic (Issue #55, ADR-0013): the full commerce contour on the Stage 2 skeleton — catalog (Product → Offer → Price), mutable Cart, checkout as a business command, immutable Order purchase facts with the mutable payment state — behind the same enforcement chain, IS-005 guard, audit journal and published client. Live operations: twelve — create and read one owned Product, define one Offer, set one Price, open/read/mutate one owned Cart, checkout, read one owned Order, record its payment.",
